#!/bin/bash
# Login starter: unlock /cases, start services, open leak-hunter in Firefox
echo "Leak analysis VM: unlock the case volume"
echo "(1. your sudo password, 2. the LUKS passphrase of /cases)"
echo
if cases-open; then
  for i in $(seq 1 30); do curl -s -o /dev/null http://127.0.0.1:8090/ && break; sleep 1; done
  setsid -f firefox --new-tab http://localhost:8090 >/dev/null 2>&1
  echo; echo "Done, leak-hunter opens in Firefox. This window closes in 5 s."; sleep 5
else
  echo; echo "Not unlocked. Start again from the app menu (Open cases) or run cases-open."
  read -rp "Press Enter to close "
fi
